<title>TAIWAN: TENNIS-TAIWAN LEAD INDONESIA 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TAIWAN LEAD INDONESIA 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan lead Indonesia 2-1 in</p>
<p>their Davis Cup Asia/Oceania zone group one play-off tie after</p>
<p>losing the doubles match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Result (Indonesian names first):</p>
<p>Suistyo Wibowo/Bonis Wiryawan beat Chen Chih-jun/Lien Yu-hui</p>
<p>6-2 6-4 6-2</p>
</text>
